# Note: the 6 APKs in apk/ are ~100 MB each and exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# limit for a normal push. Pick one before your first push of apk/*.apk:
#   1) Attach them to GitHub Releases instead (see releases/), and uncomment:
#      apk/*.apk
#   2) Track them with Git LFS instead:
#      git lfs install && git lfs track "apk/*.apk" && git add .gitattributes
#   3) Ship a stripped release build (much smaller, safe to commit as-is).
# See apk/README.md and docs/BUILD.md for details.
